- Catalog common failure modes and mitigation strategies: training-serving skew, data drift/concept drift, overfitting to offline metrics, silent model degradation, feature store staleness, GPU OOM during training, reproducibility failures, A/B test interpretation errors, technical debt accumulation in ML systems
- Define communication norms: experiment result documentation standards, model decision logs, handoff protocols between exploration and productionization phases
