### 3.3 Feature Stores

| Tool | Role | Status |
|---|---|---|
| **MLFS** (in-house ML Feature Store) | Primary feature store — feature definition (Python DSL), materialization, online/offline serving, data governance | Long-term replacement for Tecton; supports UGC compliance |
| **Tecton** | Third-party feature store (being deprecated by Nov 2026) | Stream/batch feature engineering, online serving via DynamoDB |

Source: [MLFS & Tecton](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/TCH1/pages/5576660473/MLFS+Tecton), [PSA: ML Platform is deprecating Tecton](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/MLP/blog/2025/12/03/6159139910/PSA+ML+Platform+is+deprecating+Tecton)

### 3.4 Model Serving & Inference

| Tool | Role | Pattern |
|---|---|---|
| **TEAMServe** (Triton on Kubernetes) | GPU-backed model serving, real-time + batch inference | Quantization,LoRA, multi-model inference, KEDA autoscaling |
| **MSP (Model Serving Platform)** / SageMaker | Managed model deployment | Real-time endpoints, async inference, auto-scaling |
| **Launchpad** | Model validation/testing | Performance profiling before production promotion |
| **AI Gateway** | Model routing and selection | Cost/performance-based model choice |

Source: [TEAMServe - From Idea to Infrastructure](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/CAIMT/blog/2025/04/30/5229429197/TEAMServe+-+From+Idea+to+Infrastructure), [Model Serving Platform](https://hello.atlassian.net/wiki/spaces/agd/pages/5795994498/Model+Serving+Platform)

### 3.5 Data Infrastructure

| Tool | Role |
|---|---|
| **Databricks / Spark** | Large-scale data processing, notebook-based exploration |
| **Socrates Data Lake** | Primary behavioral and product usage data |
| **Plato / Kafka** | Event streaming for real-time feature computation |
| **vNext** | Data lake / warehouse |
| **Airlock** | Privacy-compliant data access with governance |

### 3.6 Observability & Monitoring

| Tool | Role |
|---|---|
| **ML Lens** | Platformized ML observability (data quality, model quality, drift detection) |
| **Splunk** | Log aggregation and search |
| **Prometheus / Grafana** | Metrics and alerting for inference services |
| **SignalFx** | Real-time infrastructure monitoring |

### 3.7 Experimentation & CI/CD

| Tool | Role |
|---|---|
| **Statsig** | Production A/B testing, feature gates, experiment analysis |
| **Bitbucket Pipelines** | CI/CD for ML code (unit tests, plan, apply) |
| **ArgoCD** | GitOps deployment for Kubernetes resources |
| **Litmus** | Internal experimentation framework |

